# Sitemap must stay in sync

This project uses a **static** `public/sitemap.xml` (not `src/app/sitemap.ts`).

## When to update the sitemap

Whenever you add, remove, or rename anything that affects public URLs:

- New or removed `src/app/**/page.tsx` routes
- URL path changes (folder renames under `src/app`)
- Major SEO/canonical URL changes

## How to update

1. Run from the `School` folder:
   ```bash
   npm run sitemap
   ```
2. Or run a production build (regenerates automatically via `postbuild`):
   ```bash
   npm run build
   ```

The generator `scripts/generate-sitemap.mjs` **auto-discovers** all `page.tsx` files under `src/app` (excluding `/api`).

## Before finishing a task

If your changes touched routes under `src/app`, **commit the updated `public/sitemap.xml`** along with your other files.

`robots.txt` already points to `https://www.mallareddyschool.com/sitemap.xml` via `src/app/robots.ts`.
